    //   (W906_NO_SOFT_SIMULTE=ON, as the build tasks' detail says), Debug / the -O2 flags. Only -DBUILD_TESTING=OFF was given,
    //   which works where the folder was configured before (its cache keeps the rest) and fails on a fresh PC: C++17 +
    //   SIMULATION, "reference to 'byte' is ambiguous" (ES02 20261008, measured). Same values = an existing cache unchanged.
