      // AI(W906-ZEROARG) 20260918: the F5 build. Only wb_serve.
      //
      // The task below builds the default `all` target: the libraries, ~60
      // test exes, and all three product exes. F5 launches exactly one of
      // them. Measured: no ctest depends on any of the three exes, and under
